    <description>DIR-868. Before save on ContractItemPrice (the object does not support after-save triggered flows). When RES_CIP_Type__c is blank, stamps it from Product2.RES_CIP_Type__c matched on ItemId, copies ItemId into RES_Product__c, and sets the matching type checkbox (RES_Unit_Check__c / RES_Payment_Plan_Check__c / RES_Installments_Check__c / RES_Service_Charge_Check__c) used by document generation. Runs on the Unit / Payment Plan / Service Charge rows the standard CreateContract action inserts; the Installment rows get RES_Installments_Check__c set by RES_Contract_AfterSave_Generate_Installment_CIP. Honours the RES_Config_Switch__c.RES_Flows_Off__c kill switch; the Get has a fault path so a failure never blocks the save.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>fIsInstallment</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>TEXT({!Get_Product.RES_CIP_Type__c}) = "Installment"</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fIsPaymentPlan</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
